    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Exciting News, Gamers!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wait is over! \ud83c\udfae AND10 Full Game is officially here! Dive into an electrifying adventure where you take control of AND10, our daring android hero, and switch between two formidable allies during intense battles. \ud83e\uddbe\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d\u2728 Combat Strategies: Mix up your combat tactics by seamlessly switching between characters. Adapt and overcome oncoming hordes of enemies with unique abilities, ensuring no two battles are ever the same. \u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f\u26a1Multiplayer version of the game will have maps that feature fast paced team battles and capture the flag.\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf20 Epic Missions: Travel through mind-bending worlds and Earth's diverse landscapes. Complete critical missions for your creator, experiencing a story that's as immersive as it is thrilling. \ud83d\udcdc\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the journey, master the combat, and be part of the saga. \ud83c\udf1f\u26a1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to gear up? Let\u2019s go! \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Exciting News, Gamers!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wait is over! \ud83c\udfae AND10 Full Game is officially here! Dive into an electrifying adventure where you take control of AND10, our daring android hero, and switch between two formidable allies during intense battles. \ud83e\uddbe\ud83d\udca5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d\u2728 Combat Strategies: Mix up your combat tactics by seamlessly switching between characters. Adapt and overcome oncoming hordes of enemies with unique abilities, ensuring no two battles are ever the same. \u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f\u26a1Multiplayer version of the game will have maps that feature fast paced team battles and capture the flag.\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c\ud83c\udf20 Epic Missions: Travel through mind-bending worlds and Earth's diverse landscapes. Complete critical missions for your creator, experiencing a story that's as immersive as it is thrilling. \ud83d\udcdc\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the journey, master the combat, and be part of the saga. \ud83c\udf1f\u26a1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to gear up? Let\u2019s go! \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</p>",
    "short_description": "The Full campaign of AND10 is a fast paced TPS based in a futuristic version of Tokyo call Neo - Tokyo. From Neo - Tokyo you can travel to far off Alien worlds and meet up with friends to trade or fight off enemies in combat in a variety of cyberpunk themed challenges.",
